SCI-003,English,"Approximately how old is the Himalayan mountain range, in geological terms?",The provided text doesn’t contain information about the age of the Himalayan mountain range. It focuses on Nepal's vaccination coverage data and related studies.,Approximately 50-60 million years old,Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
SCI-003,Nepali,"भूगर्भीय हिसाबले, हिमालय पर्वतशृंखला अनुमानित रूपमा कति पुरानो हो?","भूगर्બી આધારિત રીતે, હીરાલે પર્વત શ્રેણીનો અંદાજ છે તે લગભગ 300 મિલિયન વર્ષો જૂની હોઈ શકે છે.",लगभग ५–६ करोड वर्ष पुरानो,Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
SCI-004,English,"Approximately how much does Mount Everest's height increase each year, and why?","The text doesn’t provide the exact rate of change in Mount Everest’s height. It states that the glacier has lost approximately 55 meters of thickness in the last 25 years and is thinning more than 80 times faster than formation time (2,000 years).

Therefore, I can't answer your question with certainty based on the provided text.","Roughly 10 milimeters per year per year, due to collison between the Indian and Eurasian tectonic plates forces the land to buckle and rise upward.",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
SCI-004,Nepali,"सगरमाथाको उचाइ हरेक वर्ष लगभग कति बढ्छ, र किन?","According to the National Geographic study, Sagarmatha’s height increases approximately by 1.5 meters every year. This is due to glacial melt and erosion caused by warmer temperatures.","भारतीय र युरेसियाली टेक्टोनिक प्लेटहरूबीचको ठोक्किएका कारण उत्पन्न हुने बलले जमिनलाई खुम्चिन र माथि उठ्न बाध्य पार्छ, जसले गर्दा जमिनको सतहमा प्रतिवर्ष करिब १० मिलिमिटरको दरले परिवर्तन आउँछ।",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
