EDU-080,Nepali,सन् २०१५ को संविधानदेखि नेपालमा ७७ जिल्ला र ७ प्रदेश छन्। औसतमा प्रत्येक प्रदेशमा कति जिल्ला पर्छ (एक दशमलव स्थानसम्म)?,"According to the provided text, the average number of districts per province in Nepal is 7. The text states that there are 7 provinces and the total number of districts is 77. Therefore, the average number of districts per province is 7 / 77 = 0.0906.  Rounded to one decimal place, this is approximately 0.09.","लगभग ११.० जिल्ला प्रति प्रदेश (७७ ÷ ७ = ठ्याक्कै ११) — यद्यपि वास्तविक वितरण असमान छ, प्रदेशअनुसार ८ देखि १४ जिल्लासम्म फरक पर्छ",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
EDU-081,English,The 2018 Right to Free and Compulsory Education Act sets a future deadline after which people without basic education become ineligible for certain jobs/elections. What is the exact Nepali calendar (Bikram Sambat) year of that deadline?,The 2018 Right to Free and Compulsory Education Act set a future deadline after which people without basic education become ineligible for certain jobs/elections. The exact Nepali calendar (Bikram Sambat) year of that deadline is **2047**.,2085 BS (corresponding to April 2028 AD),Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
EDU-081,Nepali,२०१८ को अनिवार्य तथा निःशुल्क शिक्षा सम्बन्धी ऐनले आधारभूत शिक्षा नभएकालाई निश्चित जागिर/निर्वाचनका लागि अयोग्य बनाउने भविष्यको म्याद तोकेको छ। सो म्यादको ठ्याक्कै नेपाली सम्वत् (विक्रम सम्वत्) वर्ष के हो?,२०१८ को अनिवार्य तथा निःशुल्क शिक्षा सम्बन्धी ऐनले आधारभूत शिक्षा नभएकालाई निश्चित जागिर/निर्वाचनका लागि अयोग्य बनाउने भविष्यको म्यादको ठ्याक्कै नेपाली सम्वत् (विक्रम सम्वत्) वर्ष २२ हो।,२०८५ साल (सन् २०२८ अप्रिलसँग मेल खान्छ),Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
SCI-076,English,"Of Nepal's eight internationally-recognized 8,000m peaks, name the three that lie entirely within Nepali territory rather than on the Nepal-China border.","The three peaks are Mount Everest, Annapurna I, and Manaslu.","Dhaulagiri I, Manaslu, and Annapurna I (the other five — Everest, Kanchenjunga, Lhotse, Makalu, and Cho Oyu — sit on or immediately along the Nepal-China border)",Partially Incorrect,Distortion,True,True
