नेपालका विनाशकारी ""गोर्खा भूकम्प"" सन् २०१५ अप्रिल २५ को गोर्खा जिल्लामा केन्द्रविन्दु भएर गएको थियो। त्यसको तीन हप्ता नपुग्दै, प्रायः पराकम्प मात्र ठानिने अर्को ठूलो भूकम्प नेपालमा पुनः गयो। यो कुन मितिमा गयो, यसको म्याग्निच्युड कति थियो, र यसको केन्द्रविन्दु कुन जिल्ला(हरू) मा थियो (गोर्खा होइन)?

**उत्तर:**
नेपालका विनाशकारी ""गोर्खा भूकम्प"" सन् २०१५ अप्रिल २५ को गोर्खा जिल्लामा केन्द्रविन्दु भएर गएको थियो। त्यसको तीन हप्ता नपुग्दै, प्रायः पराकम्प मात्र ठानिने अर्को ठूलो भूकम्प नेपालमा पुनः गयो। यो कुन मितिमा गयो, यसको म्याग्निच्युड कति थियो, र यसको केन्द्रविन्दु कुन जिल्ला(हरू) मा थियो (गोर्खा होइन","दोस्रो ठूलो भूकम्प सन् २०१५ मे १२ मा गएको थियो, जसको मोमेन्ट म्याग्निच्युड करिब ७.२–७.३ थियो। यसको केन्द्रविन्दु डोलखा र सिन्धुपाल्चोक जिल्लाको सीमानाजिक, कोदारीबाट करिब १८ किमी दक्षिण-पूर्वमा थियो — गोर्खा जिल्लामा होइन, जहाँ अप्रिल २५ को मूल भूकम्पको केन्द्रविन्दु थियो।",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
HEA-088,English,"Two different Nepali women named ""Pasang Lhamu Sherpa"" are both linked to Mount Everest, 14 years apart. One became the first Nepali woman to summit Everest but died during the descent. In what year did she summit and die, and how is she different from the mountaineer known as ""Pasang Lhamu Sherpa Akita,"" with whom she is sometimes confused?","The answer is **2073**. She summited Everest in 2073. She died during the descent, likely due to altitude sickness or other complications. “Pasang Lhamu Sherpa Akita” was a Nepali mountaineer who also climbed Everest but tragically passed away before reaching the summit.","The original Pasang Lhamu Sherpa summited Everest and died during the descent on 22 April 1993, becoming the first Nepali woman to reach the top. She is a different person from Pasang Lhamu Sherpa Akita, a younger mountaineer who climbed Everest in 2007 — 14 years later — survived, and went on to climb K2 in 2014; the two are often mixed up simply for sharing the same name.",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
HEA-088,Nepali,"""पासाङ ल्हामु शेर्पा"" नाम गरेका दुई फरक नेपाली महिला सगरमाथासँग जोडिएका छन्, १४ वर्षको फरकमा। एउटी सगरमाथा चढ्ने पहिलो नेपाली महिला बनिन् तर ओर्लंदा मृत्यु भयो। उनी कुन वर्ष चढेर मृत्यु भइन्, र कहिलेकाहीँ उनीसँग भ्रमित हुने पर्वतारोही ""पासाङ ल्हामु शेर्पा अकिता""भन्दा उनी कसरी फरक छिन्?","पासाङ ल्हामु शेर्पा नाम भएका दुई अलग-अलग नेपाली महिला सगरमाथासँग जोडिएका छन्, १४ वर्षको फरकमा। एउटी सगरमाथा चढ्ने पहिलो नेपाली महिला बनिन् तर ओर्लंदा मृत्यु भयो। उनी कुन वर्ष चढेर मृत्यु भइन्, र कहिलेकाहीँ उनीसँग भ्रमित हुने पर्वतारोही ""पासाङ ल्हामु शेर्पा अकिता""भन्दा उनी कसरी फरक छिन्?

ANSWER:
पासाङ ल्हामु शेर्पालाई सगरमाथाको चढाइमा पहिलो नेपाली महिला मानिन्छ। ओर्लंदा मृत्यु भयो, र तिस वर्षपछि पनि ती चढीँन्।","मूल पासाङ ल्हामु शेर्पाले सगरमाथा आरोहण गरी १९९३ अप्रिल २२ मा ओर्लंदा मृत्यु भइन्, र सगरमाथा टुप्पोमा पुग्ने पहिलो नेपाली महिला बनिन्। उनी पासाङ ल्हामु शेर्पा अकिताभन्दा फरक व्यक्ति हुन्, जो १४ वर्षपछि सन् २००७ मा सगरमाथा चढेकी कान्छी पर्वतारोही हुन्, बाँचिन्, र सन् २०१४ मा के२ समेत आरोहण गरिन्; उस्तै नामका कारण यी दुई प्रायः भ्रमित हुने गर्छन्।",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
HEA-089,English,"Nepal recorded South Asia's first confirmed COVID-19 case, but the patient had already returned from Wuhan and even been discharged from isolation before his test came back positive. On what date was the case officially confirmed, and roughly how many days after his return from Wuhan was that?","The case was officially confirmed on **January 20, 2020**. Approximately **21 days** after his return from Wuhan.","Nepal's first COVID-19 case was officially confirmed on 23 January 2020 — a 32-year-old man who had returned from Wuhan on 9 January 2020, so confirmation came roughly two weeks (about 14 days) after his return; he had already been discharged from hospital observation by the time the positive result came back.",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
HEA-089,Nepali,"नेपालले दक्षिण एसियाको पहिलो पुष्टि भएको कोभिड-१९ केस दर्ता गर्‍यो, तर बिरामी वुहानबाट फर्किसकेका र परीक्षण नतिजा पोजिटिभ आउनुअघि नै आइसोलेसनबाट डिस्चार्ज भइसकेका थिए। यो केस आधिकारिक रूपमा कुन मितिमा पुष्टि भयो, र वुहानबाट फर्किएको करिब कति दिनपछि यस्तो भयो?","नेपालले दक्षिण एसियाको पहिलो पुष्टि भएको कोभिड-१९ केस दर्ता गर्‍यो, तर बिरामी वुहानबाट फर्किसकेका र परीक्षण नतिजा पोजिटिभ आउनुअघि नै आइसोलेसनबाट डिस्चार्ज भइसकेका थिए। यो केस आधिकारिक रूपमा कुन मितिमा पुष्टि भयो, र वुहानबाट फर्किएको करिब कति दिनपछि यस्तो भयो?

उत्तर:
नेपालले दक्षिण एसियाको पहिलो पुष्टि भएको कोभिड-१९ केस दर्ता गर्‍यो, तर बिरामी वुहानबाट फर्किसकेका र परीक्षण नतिजा पोजिटिभ आउनुअघि नै आइसोलेसनबाट डिस्चार्ज भइसकेका थिए। यो केस आधिकारिक रूपमा **२३ मार्च २०२२** मितिमा पुष्टि भयो। वुहानबाट फर्किएको करिब **१४ दिन** पछी यस्तो भयो।","नेपालको पहिलो कोभिड-१९ केस आधिकारिक रूपमा सन् २०२० जनवरी २३ मा पुष्टि भयो — ३२ वर्षीय पुरुष जो सन् २०२० जनवरी ९ मा वुहानबाट फर्किएका थिए, त्यसैले पुष्टि हुँदा उनको फर्किएको करिब दुई हप्ता (करिब १४ दिन) भइसकेको थियो; नतिजा आउँदा उनी अस्पतालको अवलोकनबाट डिस्चार्ज भइसकेका थिए।",Partially Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
EDU-089,English,"Nepal's 2021 census reported male and female literacy rates (population aged 5 and above) that differ by a wide margin. Which gender has the higher rate, and roughly how many percentage points separate the two figures?","According to Nepal’s 2021 Census data, male literacy rates were approximately 86.7% while female literacy rates were approximately 75.3%. This means that males have a higher rate than females.","Male literacy (about 83.6%) is higher than female literacy (about 69.4%), a gap of roughly 14 percentage points — even though the combined overall literacy rate is often quoted as around 76%, which can mask how wide the gender gap actually is.",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
EDU-089,Nepali,"नेपालको सन् २०२१ को जनगणनाले ५ वर्ष र माथिका जनसंख्याको पुरुष र महिला साक्षरता दर फरक-फरक देखाएको छ। कुन लिङ्गको दर बढी छ, र दुई अंकबीच करिब कति प्रतिशत बिन्दुको फरक छ?","नेपालको सन् २०२१ को जनगणनाले ५ वर्ष र माथिका जनसंख्याको पुरुष र महिला साक्षरता दर फरक-फरक देखाएको छ। कुन लिङ्गको दर बढी छ, र दुई अंकबीच करिब कति प्रतिशत बिन्दुको फरक छ?

उत्तर:
पुरुषहरूको साक्षरता दर महिलाहरूपुर साक्षरता दर भन्दा १ अंक ज़्यादा छ।","पुरुष साक्षरता दर (करिब ८३.६%) महिला साक्षरता दर (करिब ६९.४%) भन्दा बढी छ, जुन करिब १४ प्रतिशत बिन्दुको फरक हो — यद्यपि समग्र साक्षरता दर प्रायः करिब ७६% भनी उल्लेख गरिन्छ, जसले लैंगिक खाडल कति ठूलो छ भन्ने कुरा लुकाउन सक्छ।",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
EDU-090,English,"Nepal's Constitution (Article 31) does not guarantee the same thing at every grade level — one level is both ""compulsory AND free,"" while a higher level is only ""free"" but not compulsory. Which grade is the compulsory-and-free cutoff, and which grade is the free-only cutoff?","Nepal’s Constitution (Article 31) does not guarantee the same thing at every grade level — one level is both “compulsory AND free,” while a higher level is only “free” but not compulsory. Which grade is the compulsory-and-free cutoff, and which grade is the free-only cutoff?

The compulsory-and-free cutoff is Grade 1. The free-only cutoff is Grade 2.","Basic education up to grade 8 is guaranteed as both compulsory and free, while education up to the secondary level (grade 12) is guaranteed as free only, with no compulsory requirement — a distinction that's easy to flatten into a single blanket ""free and compulsory through grade 12"" guarantee.",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
EDU-090,Nepali,"नेपालको संविधान (धारा ३१) ले हरेक कक्षा तहमा एउटै कुराग्यारेन्टी गर्दैन — एउटा तह ""अनिवार्य र निःशुल्क"" दुवै छ, जबकि माथिल्लो तह केवल ""निःशुल्क"" मात्र छ, अनिवार्य होइन। कुन कक्षा अनिवार्य-र-निःशुल्कको सीमा हो, र कुन कक्षा निःशुल्क-मात्रको सीमा हो?","नेपालको संविधान (धारा ३१) ले अनिवार्य-र-निःशुल्कको सीमा हो। यसमा, एक तह ""अनिवार्य"" भनीन्छ, तर अर्की तह ""निःशुल्क"" भनीन्छ। माथिल्लो तह र यो तहले केवल निःशुल्कमात्रको सीमा हो।","आधारभूत शिक्षा (कक्षा ८ सम्म) अनिवार्य र निःशुल्क दुवै ग्यारेन्टी गरिएको छ, जबकि माध्यमिक तह (कक्षा १२ सम्म) सम्मको शिक्षा निःशुल्क मात्र ग्यारेन्टी गरिएको छ, अनिवार्य होइन — यो भिन्नतालाई प्रायः एउटै ""कक्षा १२ सम्म निःशुल्क र अनिवार्य"" भनी सरलीकरण गरिन्छ।",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
EDU-091,English,"Nepal's 2015 Constitution created seven provinces but left them numbered rather than named. Six of the seven provinces were given official names fairly quickly, but one province took until 2023 to get an official name. Which province was the last to be named, what name did it finally receive, and after what was it named?",The last province to be named is Lumbini Province. It received its official name in 2023. Its name is Lumbini.,"Province No. 1, in Nepal's east, was the last of the seven provinces to receive an official name. Its provincial assembly voted on 1 March 2023 to name it ""Koshi Province,"" after the Koshi River — about six years after the province itself was created, and after a rival proposal to instead call it ""Kirat Limbuwan Sagarmatha"" was rejected.",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
EDU-091,Nepali,"नेपालको सन् २०१५ को संविधानले सात प्रदेश बनायो तर तिनलाई नामाकरण नगरी नम्बर मात्र दियो। सात मध्ये छ प्रदेशले चाँडै आधिकारिक नाम पाए, तर एउटा प्रदेशले सन् २०२३ सम्म कुनै आधिकारिक नाम पाएको थिएन। कुन प्रदेश सबैभन्दा पछि नामाकरण भयो, अन्ततः कुन नाम पायो, र केको नाममा राखियो?","नेपालको सन् २०१५ को संविधानले सात प्रदेश बना्यो तर तिनलाई नामाकरण नगरी नम्बर मात्र दियो। सात मध्ये छ प्रदेशले चाँडै आधिकारिक नाम पाए, तर एउटा प्रदेशले सन् २०२३ सम्म कुनै आधिकारिक नाम पाएको थिएन। कुन प्रदेश सबैभन्दा पछि नामाकरण भयो, अन्ततः कुन नाम पायो, र केको नाममा राखियो?

उत्तर:
नेपालको ७ प्रदेशहरूलाई नामाकरण नगरी नम्बरमात्र दियो, तर एक प्रदेशले सन् २०२३ मा आधिकारिक नाम पाए, जबकि अर्काँही प्रदेशले पहिले नै नामाकरण भयो। यहाँ सबैभन्दा पछि नामाकरण भएको प्रदेश छ नेपाल област।","नेपालको पूर्वको प्रदेश नं. १ सात मध्ये सबैभन्दा पछि आधिकारिक नाम पाउने प्रदेश थियो। यसको प्रदेशसभाले सन् २०२३ मार्च १ मा यसलाई कोशी नदीको नाममा ""कोशी प्रदेश"" नामाकरण गर्ने निर्णय गर्‍यो — प्रदेश स्थापना भएको करिब छ वर्षपछि, र ""किरात लिम्बुवान सगरमाथा"" राख्ने विकल्प प्रस्ताव अस्वीकृत भएपछि।",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
EDU-092,English,"What is the difference between the year-on-year (YoY) Consumer Price Index (CPI) for the food and beverage group in the third quarter of 2080/81 and the YoY CPI for the ""Non-food and Services"" group in the same period?","Okay, let's break down this question. Here’s a breakdown of how to answer it based on the provided text:

**Understanding the Question:**

The question asks us to compare two CPI figures – one for food and beverage (third quarter 2080/81) and another for non-food and services (same period). We need to determine the difference in their growth rates.

**Analyzing the Text:**

*   **“According to Nepal Demographic and Health Survey (NDHS) data analyzed in a peer-reviewed study…”**: This tells us the source of the CPI figures is an analysis based on data from the NDHS, which is a survey about demographics and health in Nepal.
*   **“HEA-093,Healthcare,Immunization,Adversarial/Trap,What,Hard,”**:  This indicates that the study focuses on healthcare, specifically vaccinations, and it's related to a ""trap"" or challenge – likely an analysis of vaccine effectiveness.

**The Answer:**

The difference between the two CPI figures is **approximately 4.17%**.

**Explanation based on the text:**

*   The “Non-food and Services” CPI increased by approximately 4.17% from Q3 2080/81 to Q3 2081/82.
*   The ""Food and Beverage"" CPI increased by approximately 4.17% from Q3 2080/81 to Q3 2081/82.

**Therefore, the answer is 4.17%.**",1.10 percentage points (Food & Beverage YoY CPI: 5.04%; Non-food and Services YoY CPI: 3.94%),Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
EDU-092,Nepali,"आर्थिक वर्ष २०८०/८१ को तेस्रो त्रैमासिकमा ""खाद्य तथा पेय पदार्थ"" समूह र ""गैर-खाद्य तथा सेवा"" समूहको वार्षिक (YoY) उपभोक्ता मूल्य सूचकांक (CPI) बीच के भिन्नता छ? यसले शिक्षाको वास्तविक लागत तथा शैक्षिक सामग्रीमा हुने घरायसी खर्चमा प्रभाव पार्छ।","According to the provided text, the difference between the YoY CPI for the third quarterly of 2080/81 between the Food and Beverage group and the Non-Food & Service group is **0.3%**. The text states that this difference is primarily influenced by the impact on education costs.","१.१० प्रतिशत विन्दु (खाद्य तथा पेय पदार्थ: ५.०४%, गैर-खाद्य: ४.९५%)",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
EDU-093,English,"In the third quarter of 2080/81, total exports were Rs. 62.32 billion. If exports to India constituted approximately 70% of this, what is the approximate value of exports to India? If the total exports in the same period of the previous fiscal year were Rs. 51.70 billion, what is the percentage increase in total exports? This affects the education sector's ability to import books, IT equipment, and other learning materials, as well as the government's revenue for funding education.","Here’s a breakdown of the calculation and answer:

**1. Calculate the approximate value of exports to India:**

* Total Exports = Rs. 62.32 billion
* Percentage of total exports allocated to India = 70%
* Value of exports to India = (70/100) * Rs. 62.32 billion = Rs. 43.62 billion

**Therefore, the approximate value of exports to India is Rs. 43.62 billion.**

**2. Calculate the percentage increase in total exports:**

* Original Total Exports (Previous Fiscal Year): Rs. 51.70 billion
* New Total Exports (Third Quarter 2080/81): Rs. 62.32 billion
* Increase = (New - Old) / Old * 100
    = (62.32 - 51.70) / 51.70 * 100
    = 10.62 / 51.70 * 100
    ≈ 20.48%

**Therefore, the approximate percentage increase in total exports is approximately 20.48%.**

**Important Note:** The calculation assumes a constant growth rate for all exports.  The actual percentage increase could be slightly different depending on the specific factors influencing export volume during this period.","India-bound exports were approximately Rs. 43.62 billion (70% of Rs. 62.32 billion). Total exports increased by approximately 20.5% year-on-year, rising from Rs. 51.70 billion to Rs. 62.32 billion (an increase of Rs. 10.62 billion).",Partially Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
EDU-093,Nepali,"आर्थिक वर्ष २०८०/८१ को तेस्रो त्रैमासिकमा कुल निर्यात रु. ६२.३२ अर्ब रहेको थियो। यदि यसको लगभग ७०% भारततर्फको निर्यात रहेको मानिने हो भने, भारततर्फको निर्यातको अनुमानित मूल्य कति हुन्छ? यदि अघिल्लो आर्थिक वर्षको उही अवधिमा कुल निर्यात रु. ५१.७० अर्ब रहेको थियो भने, कुल निर्यातमा प्रतिशत वृद्धि कति भयो? यसले शिक्षा क्षेत्रका लागि पुस्तक, आईटी उपकरण, र अन्य शैक्षिक सामग्री आयात गर्ने क्षमता तथा शिक्षामा लगानी गर्ने सरकारी राजस्वलाई पनि असर गर्छ।","Let's break down this problem step-by-step.

**1. Calculate the estimated India export value:**

* Total exports in FY2080/2081 = ₹62,32,00,000 (approximately)
* Approximately 70% of these exports are to India:
   ₹62,32,00,000 * 0.70 = ₹43,62,40,000

**2. Calculate the estimated total export value:**

* Total exports in FY2080/2081 = ₹51,70,00,000 (approximately)
* Difference between these two figures: ₹62,32,00,000 - ₹51,70,00,000 = ₹10,62,00,000

**3. Calculate the percentage increase in export value:**

* Increase in export value = (₹10,62,00,000 / ₹51,70,00,000) * 100
* Increase in export value ≈ 20.48%

**Answer:**

The estimated total export value of India is approximately ₹10,62,00,000 (approximately).  If the total exports in FY2080/2081 were ₹51,70,00,000, then there was a 20.48% increase in export value. This has an impact on government revenue related to education and investment.","भारततर्फको निर्यात लगभग रु. ४३.६२ अर्ब हुन्छ (रु. ६२.३२ अर्बको ७०%)। कुल निर्यातमा वार्षिक आधारमा लगभग २०.५% वृद्धि भयो, जुन रु. ५१.७० अर्बबाट बढेर रु. ६२.३२ अर्ब पुग्यो (रु. १०.६२ अर्बको वृद्धि)।",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
EDU-094,English,"According to Nepal Rastra Bank's report based on eleven months' data of fiscal year 2082/83 (2025/26), in US dollar terms, by what percentage did remittance inflows increase in the review period, and what was the year-on-year growth rate of remittance inflows in the same eleven-month period of the previous fiscal year?","According to Nepal Rastra Bank’s report based on eleven months' data of fiscal year 2082/83 (2025/26), remittance inflows increased by 17.4% in US dollar terms compared to the previous eleven-month period of the same fiscal year. The year-on-year growth rate of remittance inflows was 12.9%.","Remittance inflows increased 29.6% to USD 14.59 billion in the eleven months of 2082/83. In the same eleven-month period of the previous fiscal year (2081/82), such inflows had increased by 12.8%.",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
EDU-094,Nepali,"नेपाल राष्ट्र बैंकको आर्थिक वर्ष २०८२/८३ (२०२५/२६) को एघार महिनाको तथ्याङ्कमा आधारित प्रतिवेदन अनुसार, अमेरिकी डलर सन्दर्भमा समीक्षा अवधिमा विप्रेषण (रेमिट्यान्स) आप्रवाह कति प्रतिशतले वृद्धि भयो, र अघिल्लो आर्थिक वर्षको सोही एघार महिने अवधिमा विप्रेषण आप्रवाहको वार्षिक वृद्धिदर कति थियो?","The Nepali Bank’s fiscal year 2082/83 (FY 2025/26) based report, derived from the 2025/26 fiscal year’s monthly statistics, reported that approximately **17.4%** of the increase in remittances during the review period was due to a change in the US dollar reference rate. The annual increase in remittance revenue during the previous fiscal year (FY 2024/25) was approximately **8.3%**.",आर्थिक वर्ष २०८२/८३ को एघार महिनामा विप्रेषण आप्रवाह २९.६% ले बढेर अमेरिकी डलर १४.५९ अर्ब पुगेको छ। अघिल्लो आर्थिक वर्ष (२०८१/८२) को सोही एघार महिने अवधिमा यस्तो आप्रवाह १२.८% ले बढेको थियो।,Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
EDU-095,English,"Per Nepal Rastra Bank's eleven-month report of fiscal year 2082/83, what was Nepal's net secondary income (net transfer) in Rs. billion during the review period, and what was the corresponding figure in the same eleven-month period of the previous fiscal year?","According to the provided text, Nepal’s net secondary income (net transfer) in fiscal year 2082/83 was Rs. 167.4 billion. The corresponding figure for the previous fiscal year was Rs. 159.8 billion.","Net secondary income (net transfer) reached Rs. 2321.07 billion in the eleven months of 2082/83, compared to Rs. 1669.51 billion in the same period of the previous fiscal year (2081/82).",Correct,None,False,False
EDU-095,Nepali,"नेपाल राष्ट्र बैंकको आर्थिक वर्ष २०८२/८३ को एघार महिने प्रतिवेदन अनुसार, समीक्षा अवधिमा नेपालको खुद द्वितीयक आय (खुद हस्तान्तरण) रु. अर्बमा कति रह्यो, र अघिल्लो आर्थिक वर्षको सोही एघार महिने अवधिमा सो अङ्क कति थियो?","नेपाल राष्ट्र बैंकको आर्थिक वर्ष २०८२/८३ को एघાર महिने प्रतिवेदन अनुसार, खुद द्वितीयक आय (खुद हस्तान्तरण) रु. अर्बमा लगभग ९७९ बिलियन रुपैय रह्यो। अघिल्लो आर्थिक वर्षको सोही एघાર महिने अवधिमा सो अङ्क ७४६ बिलियन रुपैय थियो।","आर्थिक वर्ष २०८२/८३ को एघार महिनामा खुद द्वितीयक आय (खुद हस्तान्तरण) रु. २३२१.०७ अर्ब पुगेको छ, जुन अघिल्लो आर्थिक वर्ष (२०८१/८२) को सोही अवधिमा रु. १६६९.५१ अर्ब थियो।",Correct,None,False,False
EDU-096,English,"In the eleven months of fiscal year 2082/83, how many Nepali workers received first-time approval for foreign employment, and how many received approval for renewed entry, according to Nepal Rastra Bank?","According to Nepal Rastra Bank data, in the eleven months of fiscal year 2082/83, there were 1,657 Nepali workers who received first-time approval for foreign employment and 1,429 Nepali workers who received approval for renewed entry.","367,211 workers received first-time approval for foreign employment, and 355,735 workers received approval for renewed entry, in the eleven months of 2082/83.",Correct,None,False,False
EDU-096,Nepali,"आर्थिक वर्ष २०८२/८३ को एघार महिनामा कति नेपाली कामदारले वैदेशिक रोजगारीको लागि पहिलोपटक स्वीकृति पाए, र कतिले नवीकरण गरी पुन: प्रवेशको स्वीकृति पाए, नेपाल राष्ट्र बैंकका अनुसार?","नेपाल राष्ट्र बैंकका अनुसार आर्थिक वर्ष २०८२/८३ मा एघार महिनामा लगभग ८०,००० कामदारले वैदेशिक रोजगारीको लागि पहिलोपटक स्वीकृति पाए र कतिले नवीकरण गरी पुन: प्रवेशको स्वीकृति पाए, नेपालमा लगभग ३५,००० कामदारले पहिलोपटक स्वीकृति पाए।","आर्थिक वर्ष २०८२/८३ को एघार महिनामा ३,६७,२११ कामदारले वैदेशिक रोजगारीको लागि पहिलोपटक स्वीकृति पाएका छन्, र ३,५५,७३५ कामदारले नवीकरण गरी पुन: प्रवेशको स्वीकृति पाएका छन्।",Correct,None,False,False
EDU-097,English,"In the eleven months of fiscal year 2082/83, private sector credit extended by commercial banks, development banks, and finance companies each increased by what respective percentage, according to Nepal Rastra Bank?",The provided text doesn’t contain the answer to this question. It focuses on a study analyzing Nepal's vaccination coverage data.,"Private sector credit increased 6.3% from commercial banks, 5.6% from development banks, and 3.9% from finance companies in the eleven months of 2082/83.",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
EDU-097,Nepali,"आर्थिक वर्ष २०८२/८३ को एघार महिनामा वाणिज्य बैंक, विकास बैंक, र वित्त कम्पनीहरूबाट प्रवाहित निजी क्षेत्र कर्जा क्रमशः कति-कति प्रतिशतले बढ्यो, नेपाल राष्ट्र बैंकका अनुसार?","According to the State Bank of Nepal, in the first eight months of fiscal year 2082/83, private sector loans from commercial banks and financial companies increased by:

*   **Commercial Banks:** Approximately 45%
*   **Development Banks:** Approximately 30%
*   **Finance Companies:** Approximately 25%

Please note that these figures are estimates based on available data.","आर्थिक वर्ष २०८२/८३ को एघार महिनामा निजी क्षेत्र कर्जा वाणिज्य बैंकबाट ६.३%, विकास बैंकबाट ५.६%, र वित्त कम्पनीबाट ३.९% ले वृद्धि भएको छ।",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
EDU-098,English,"As of mid-June 2026 (per Nepal Rastra Bank's eleven-month 2082/83 report), what share of total outstanding BFI credit was secured against current-assets collateral, and what share was secured against land collateral?","As of mid-June 2026 (per Nepal Rastra Bank's eleven-month 2082/83 report), the share of total outstanding BFI credit secured against current-assets collateral was 75.4%, and the share secured against land collateral was 24.6%.","14.7% of total outstanding BFI credit was secured against current-assets collateral (such as agricultural and non-agricultural products), and 63.6% was secured against land collateral, as of mid-June 2026.",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
EDU-098,Nepali,"२०२६ जुन मध्य (मध्य-असारसम्म) सम्ममा (नेपाल राष्ट्र बैंकको आर्थिक वर्ष २०८२/८३ को एघार महिने प्रतिवेदन अनुसार), बैंक तथा वित्तीय संस्थाहरूको कुल बक्यौता कर्जामध्ये कति अंश चालु सम्पत्ति धितोमा र कति अंश जग्गा धितोमा सुरक्षित थियो?","According to the Nepal Central Bank’s Economic Year 2082/83 report, the total value of assets held by banks and financial institutions was approximately 67.2% secured and 32.8% outstanding (loan).",२०२६ जुन मध्यसम्ममा बैंक तथा वित्तीय संस्थाहरूको कुल बक्यौता कर्जामध्ये १४.७% चालु सम्पत्ति (कृषि तथा गैर-कृषि उत्पादन जस्ता) धितोमा र ६३.६% जग्गा धितोमा सुरक्षित रहेको छ।,Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
HEA-090,English,"Nepal's maternal mortality ratio (MMR) has been reported at several different figures depending on the source and survey year — 539, 281, 239, 151, and 142 deaths per 100,000 live births. Which figure corresponds to which milestone: the 1996 NDHS estimate, the 2006 NDHS estimate, the 2016 figure for which Nepal received a Millennium Development Goals award, the 2021 National Statistics Office estimate, and the most recent UN/WHO estimate reported around April 2025?","Here’s the breakdown of the maternal mortality ratio (MMR) figures you provided, corresponding to each milestone:

*   **1996 NDHS Estimate:** 539 deaths per 100,000 live births.
*   **2006 NDHS Estimate:** 281 deaths per 100,000 live births.
*   **2016 Millennium Development Goals (MDG) Award Figure:** 151 deaths per 100,000 live births.
*   **2021 National Statistics Office Estimate:** 142 deaths per 100,000 live births.
*   **UN/WHO Estimate around April 2025:** The most recent figure is not readily available; however, it’s likely to be *slightly* lower than the previous figures, potentially around **130-140 deaths per 100,000 live births**.

Let me know if you'd like a more detailed explanation of any specific figure!","539 = 1996 NDHS estimate; 281 = 2006 NDHS estimate; 239 = the 2016 figure (down from 539 in 1996) for which Nepal received a Millennium Development Goals award; 151 = the 2021 National Statistics Office estimate; 142 = the most recent UN-IGME/WHO estimate, reported around April 2025.",Partially Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
HEA-090,Nepali,"नेपालको मातृ मृत्युदर (एमएमआर) स्रोत र सर्वेक्षण वर्ष अनुसार फरक-फरक अङ्कमा प्रतिवेदित भएको छ — प्रति १,००,००० जीवित जन्ममा ५३९, २८१, २३९, १५१, र १४२ मृत्यु। कुन अङ्क कुन सन्दर्भसँग मेल खान्छ: सन् १९९६ को एनडीएचएस अनुमान, सन् २००६ को एनडीएचएस अनुमान, सन् २०१६ को अङ्क (जसका लागि नेपालले सहस्राब्दी विकास लक्ष्य पुरस्कार पायो), सन् २०२१ को राष्ट्रिय तथ्याङ्क कार्यालयको अनुमान, र सन् २०२५ अप्रिलतिर प्रतिवेदित नवीनतम संयुक्त राष्ट्र/विश्व स्वास्थ्य संगठनको अनुमान?","सन् १९९६ को एनडीएचएस अनुमान, सन् २००६ का एनडीएचएस अनुमान, सन् २०१६ का अङ्क (जसका लागि नेपालले सहस्राब्दी विकास लक्ष्य पुरस्कार पायो), सन् २०२१ का राष्ट्रिय तथ्याङ्क कार्यालयको अनुमान, र सन् २०२५ अप्रिलतिर प्रतिवेदित नवीनतम संयुक्त राष्ट्र/विश्व स्वास्थ्य संगठनको अनुमान।

यहाँ प्रत्येक वर्षको अङ्कको विवरण दिइएको छ:
*   सन् १९९६ को एनडीएचएस अनुमान - ५३९,२८१, २३९, १५१
*   सन् २००६ का एनडीएचएस अनुमान - २५४,७०५
*   सन् २०१६ का अङ्क (जसका लागि नेपालले सहस्राब्दी विकास लक्ष्य पुरस्कार पायो) - १४२
*   सन् २०२१ का राष्ट्रिय तथ्याङ्क कार्यालयको अनुमान - ५३९,२८१, २३९, १५१
*   सन् २०२५ अप्रिलतिर प्रतिवेदित नवीनतम संयुक्त राष्ट्र/विश्व स्वास्थ्य संगठनको अनुमान - ६७६,४०७","५३९ = सन् १९९६ को एनडीएचएस अनुमान; २८१ = सन् २००६ को एनडीएचएस अनुमान; २३९ = सन् २०१६ को अङ्क (१९९६ को ५३९ बाट घटेको), जसका लागि नेपालले सहस्राब्दी विकास लक्ष्य पुरस्कार पायो; १५१ = सन् २०२१ को राष्ट्रिय तथ्याङ्क कार्यालयको अनुमान; १४२ = सन् २०२५ अप्रिलतिर प्रतिवेदित नवीनतम संयुक्त राष्ट्र/विश्व स्वास्थ्य संगठनको अनुमान।",Correct,None,False,False
HEA-091,English,"Two Nepali news reports published less than a year apart give opposite headline pictures of Nepal's institutional delivery rate trend — one (May 2025) says the rate ""declined sharply"", another (February 2026) says it rose to 90.5%. What rate did each report cite, and what explains the apparent contradiction?","The first report cited a decline in the institutional delivery rate of 30% while the second reported a rise to 90.5%.

Here’s why this discrepancy likely exists:

* **Different Data Sources:** The reports are based on different data sets and methodologies.  One might use a specific survey or statistical analysis, while the other relies on a different source or interpretation of trends.
* **Timeframe Differences:** The reporting timeframe is crucial. A decline in 30% over a year is significantly more impactful than a rise to 90.5% within the same period.  The data collection methods and definitions used for these rates could differ.
* **Reporting Bias/Interpretation:** News outlets often present information with a certain perspective or interpretation, which can lead to discrepancies in reporting.

**In short, they are reporting different numbers based on their own assessment of the situation.**","The May 2025 Kathmandu Post report, citing a National Statistics Office-linked study/UN health body figures, said the institutional delivery rate had declined alarmingly (around the roughly 80% level seen in 2022), while the February 2026 Kathmandu Post report, citing the Nepal Multiple Indicator Survey (NMIS) 2024-025 by the National Statistics Office and UNICEF, said institutional delivery rose to 90.5% by 2025 from around 80% in 2022. Health officials attributed the apparent contradiction to different survey methodologies and a declining total fertility rate affecting how delivery percentages are derived, rather than an actual reversal in service use.",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
HEA-091,Nepali,"एक वर्षभन्दा कम अन्तरालमा प्रकाशित नेपालका दुई समाचार प्रतिवेदनले संस्थागत सुत्केरी दरको प्रवृत्तिबारे विपरीत चित्र देखाउँछन् — एउटा (मे २०२५) ले दर ""तीव्र रूपमा घट्यो"" भन्छ, अर्को (फेब्रुअरी २०२६) ले दर बढेर ९०.५% पुगेको भन्छ। प्रत्येक प्रतिवेदनले कुन दर उल्लेख गरेको छ, र यो देखिने विरोधाभासको कारण के हो?","Let's analyze the two news reports and determine the discrepancy in the rate of growth.

**Reports:**

*   **Report 1 (May 2025):** ""The rate of growth is remarkably low."" - This indicates a significant decline.
*   **Report 2 (February 2026):** ""The rate of growth has increased by 90.5%."" -  This signifies a substantial increase in the rate of growth.

**Cause of the Discrepancy:**

The discrepancy arises because the reports are reporting *different* rates of growth, rather than a consistent trend. The first report states a low growth rate, while the second reports an increased rate. This is a common phenomenon when data sets have different timeframes or methodologies.

Here's why this happens:

1.  **Different Time Periods:** The two reports cover different periods – one from May 2025 and the other from February 2026.
2. **Methodology Differences**: The reporting of the rate of growth may be based on different methodologies or data sources.","मे २०२५ को काठमाडौं पोस्ट प्रतिवेदनले संस्थागत सुत्केरी दर चिन्ताजनक रूपमा घटेको (सन् २०२२ मा रहेको लगभग ८०% स्तरको हाराहारीमा) उल्लेख गरेको थियो, जबकि फेब्रुअरी २०२६ को काठमाडौं पोस्ट प्रतिवेदनले राष्ट्रिय तथ्याङ्क कार्यालय र युनिसेफद्वारा गरिएको नेपाल बहु-सूचक सर्वेक्षण (एनएमआईएस) २०२४-०२५ को हवाला दिँदै सन् २०२५ सम्ममा संस्थागत सुत्केरी दर सन् २०२२ को लगभग ८०%बाट बढेर ९०.५% पुगेको जनाएको थियो। स्वास्थ्य अधिकारीहरूका अनुसार यो विरोधाभास वास्तविक उल्टो प्रवृत्तिभन्दा पनि फरक-फरक सर्वेक्षण विधि र घट्दो कुल प्रजनन दरका कारण देखिएको हो।",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
HEA-092,English,"According to Nepal's most recent health data reported in 2025, what is the neonatal mortality rate, the stillbirth rate, and the total fertility rate (TFR), and how does the neonatal mortality figure reported by WHO differ from the one separately cited by the Family Welfare Division of Nepal's Department of Health Services?","Okay, let’s break down this question based on the provided text. Here’s a response addressing each requested statistic:

**1. Neonatal Mortality Rate:**

According to the report from the WHO (World Health Organization), Nepal's neonatal mortality rate in 2025 is **13.7 deaths per 1,000 live births**.

**2. Stillbirth Rate:**

The report states that the stillbirth rate in Nepal in 2025 was **4.6 deaths per 1,000 live births.**

**3. Total Fertility Rate (TFR):**

The report indicates a total fertility rate of **1.7 children per woman** in Nepal for 2025.

**4. Difference between WHO and Nepali TFR:**

The WHO reports a neonatal mortality rate of 13.7 deaths/1,000 live births, while the Nepali figure is 4.6 deaths/1,000 live births. This difference represents a significant increase in neonatal mortality rates compared to the WHO's figures.

**Important Note:** The text highlights that the *difference* between the two figures is substantial and suggests a concerning trend.  The report emphasizes that this figure is significantly higher than what’s typically observed in other countries with similar socioeconomic conditions.

---

Let me know if you would like me to elaborate on any of these points or provide additional context!","WHO's 2025 report cites Nepal's neonatal mortality rate at 16.6 per 1,000 live births and stillbirth rate at 13.5 per 1,000 births, while Nepal's Family Welfare Division separately cited a neonatal mortality rate of 17 per 1,000 live births. The total fertility rate is estimated at about 1.76 in 2025, down from 1.94 in 2021.",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
HEA-092,Nepali,"सन् २०२५ मा प्रतिवेदित नेपालको नवीनतम स्वास्थ्य तथ्याङ्क अनुसार, नवजात मृत्युदर, मृतजन्म दर, र कुल प्रजनन दर (टीएफआर) कति हो, र विश्व स्वास्थ्य संगठनले जनाएको नवजात मृत्युदर स्वास्थ्य सेवा विभागको पारिवारिक कल्याण महाशाखाले छुट्टै उल्लेख गरेको अङ्कभन्दा कसरी फरक छ?","According to the latest health statistics available in Nepal for 2025, the neonatal mortality rate, postpartum mortality rate, and total fertility rates (TFR) are approximately **13.7 deaths per 1,000 live births**. The World Health Organization’s estimate of global maternal mortality rate is significantly lower, around **7.8 deaths per million women**, and this figure is specifically attributed to the Family Welfare Sector division within the Ministry of Public Health.

**Difference:** This difference represents a substantial reduction in the reported neonatal mortality rate compared to the WHO's estimate. The difference is approximately **4.5 deaths per 1,000 live births**.  This highlights a significant improvement in maternal health outcomes and contributes to Nepal’s overall fertility trends.","विश्व स्वास्थ्य संगठनको सन् २०२५ को प्रतिवेदनले नेपालको नवजात मृत्युदर प्रति १,००० जीवित जन्ममा १६.६ र मृतजन्म दर प्रति १,००० जन्ममा १३.५ रहेको जनाएको छ, जबकि स्वास्थ्य सेवा विभागको पारिवारिक कल्याण महाशाखाले छुट्टै रूपमा नवजात मृत्युदर प्रति १,००० जीवित जन्ममा १७ रहेको उल्लेख गरेको छ। कुल प्रजनन दर सन् २०२१ को १.९४ बाट घटेर सन् २०२५ मा लगभग १.७६ पुगेको अनुमान छ।",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
EDU-092,English,"According to MoEST's Flash I Report 2081 (2024/25), what percentage and number of Early Childhood Education and Development (ECED) enrollees are from Dalit, Janajati, and Brahman/Chhetri-and-other communities respectively, and how did each of these percentages change from the previous year's report?","According to MoEST’s Flash I Report 2081 (2024/25), here is the breakdown of the percentage and number of Early Childhood Education and Development (ECED) enrollees from Dalit, Janajati, and Brahman/Chhetri-and other communities:

*   **Dalit:** 36.7%
*   **Janjati:** 31.8%
*   **Brahman/Chhetri-and other:** 24.9%

The percentages changed from the previous year’s report (2023/24). Here's a more detailed look:

*   **Dalit:** Increased by 1.7 percentage points compared to 2023/24.
*   **Janjati:** Increased by 1.6 percentage points compared to 2023/24.
*   **Brahman/Chhetri-and other:** Increased by 0.9 percentage point compared to 2023/24.

These changes reflect the ongoing efforts to promote inclusive education and address disparities in enrollment across different communities.","199,558 children (15.3%) enrolled in ECED are from Dalit communities, down from 16.2% the previous year; 426,189 (32.7%) are Janajati, down from 34.5%; and 675,678 (51.9%) are Brahman/Chhetri and other communities, up from 31.7% the previous year.",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
EDU-092,Nepali,"शिक्षा, विज्ञान तथा प्रविधि मन्त्रालयको फ्ल्यास प्रतिवेदन २०८१ (२०२४/२५) अनुसार, प्रारम्भिक बाल विकास शिक्षा (ईसीईडी) मा भर्ना भएका बालबालिकामध्ये दलित, जनजाति, र ब्राह्मण/क्षेत्री-तथा-अन्य समुदायका बालबालिकाको प्रतिशत र संख्या क्रमशः कति छ, र अघिल्लो वर्षको प्रतिवेदनको तुलनामा प्रत्येक प्रतिशत कसरी परिवर्तन भयो?","Education, Science and Technology Ministry’s Flash Report 2024/25 according to the National Curriculum Framework (NCF), the percentage of children in early childhood development (ECD) centers for Dalit, tribal, and Brahmin/regional/other communities is as follows:

*   **Dalit:** Approximately 18.7%
*   **Tribes:** Approximately 19.3%
*   **Brahmins/Regional/Other Communities:** Approximately 12.6%

The percentage has changed from the previous year (2023/24) by approximately 1.6%.","ईसीईडीमा भर्ना भएका बालबालिकामध्ये १,९९,५५८ (१५.३%) दलित समुदायका छन्, जुन अघिल्लो वर्षको १६.२%बाट घटेको हो; ४,२६,१८९ (३२.७%) जनजाति समुदायका छन्, जुन अघिल्लो वर्षको ३४.५%बाट घटेको हो; र ६,७५,६७८ (५१.९%) ब्राह्मण/क्षेत्री तथा अन्य समुदायका छन्, जुन अघिल्लो वर्षको ३१.७%बाट बढेको हो।",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
EDU-093,English,"Per the same Flash I Report 2081 (2024/25), out of the total government-supported ECED teachers, what share were female versus male, and what were the caste/ethnicity shares (Dalit, Janajati, Brahman/Chhetri and other) among those teachers?","Okay, here's the answer to your question based on the provided Flash I Report 2081 data.

According to the report, out of the total government-supported ECED teachers (Education, Community Development & Extension), **female teachers represented approximately 56% of the workforce**, while male teachers accounted for about **44%**.  The distribution among castes and ethnicities is as follows:

*   **Dalit:** Approximately 23.7%
*   **Janajati:** Approximately 18.9%
*   **Brahman/Chhetri:** Approximately 16.5%

It’s important to note that these figures represent the *proportion of teachers* within the total workforce, not a percentage of the entire population of ECED teachers.","Of 31,418 government-supported ECED teachers, 30,498 (97.1%) were female and 1,680 (2.9%) were male. By caste/ethnicity, 2,966 (6.4%) were Dalit, 11,377 (36.2%) were Janajati, and 18,017 (57.3%) were Brahman/Chhetri and other groups.",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
EDU-093,Nepali,"उही फ्ल्यास प्रतिवेदन २०८१ (२०२४/२५) अनुसार, सरकारी सहयोग प्राप्त कुल ईसीईडी शिक्षकमध्ये महिला र पुरुषको अंश कति छ, र ती शिक्षकहरूमा जात/जाति (दलित, जनजाति, ब्राह्मण/क्षेत्री तथा अन्य) को अंश कति छ?","According to the report, there were 1,378,064 female and 1,378,064 male teachers in total. The percentage of women and men among these teachers is approximately 51.2% for women and 48.8% for men.","जम्मा ३१,४१८ सरकारी सहयोग प्राप्त ईसीईडी शिक्षकमध्ये ३०,४९८ (९७.१%) महिला र १,६८० (२.९%) पुरुष रहेका छन्। जात/जातिका आधारमा २,९६६ (६.४%) दलित, ११,३७७ (३६.२%) जनजाति, र १८,०१७ (५७.३%) ब्राह्मण/क्षेत्री तथा अन्य समूहका रहेका छन्।",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
SCI-091,English,"On what exact date was the WHO South-East Asia Region certified polio-free, how many countries make up this WHO region, and what share of the world's population then came to live in WHO regions certified polio-free?",The provided text doesn’t contain the answer to your question. The document focuses on Nepal’s vaccination coverage data and related studies. It does not include information about the WHO declaring South-East Asia polio-free or the number of countries within that region.,"The WHO South-East Asia Region was certified polio-free on 27 March 2014. The region comprises 11 countries (Bangladesh, Bhutan, Democratic People's Republic of Korea, India, Indonesia, Maldives, Myanmar, Nepal, Sri Lanka, Thailand, and Timor-Leste). With this certification, 80% of the world's population came to live in WHO regions certified polio-free.",Correct,None,False,False
SCI-091,Nepali,"विश्व स्वास्थ्य संगठनको दक्षिण-पूर्व एसिया क्षेत्रलाई ठ्याक्कै कुन मितिमा पोलियोमुक्त प्रमाणित गरिएको थियो, यस क्षेत्रमा कति देश समावेश छन्, र यो प्रमाणीकरणपछि विश्वको कति प्रतिशत जनसंख्या पोलियोमुक्त प्रमाणित क्षेत्रहरूमा बस्न पुग्यो?","विश्व स्वास्थ्य संगठनले दक्षिण-पूर्व एसिया क्षेत्रलाई ठ्याक्कै कुन मितिमा पोलियोमुक्त प्रमाणित गरेको थियो, यस क्षेत्रमा कति देश समावेश छन्, र यो प्रमाणीकरणपछि विश्वको कति प्रतिशत जनसंख्या पोलियोमुक्त प्रमाणित क्षेत्रहरूमा बस्न पुग्यो?

उत्तर: 2016 मध्ये दक्षिण-पूर्व एसिया क्षेत्रलाई पोलियोमुक्त प्रमाणित गरिएको छ। यस क्षेत्रमा 13 देश समावेश छन्:
*   अफगाजान
*   बहोरखा
*   भटान
*   कلبुन
*   किर्गिस्तान
*   कुරුँन
*   लेहठ
*   मзбеल
*   नेपाल्
*   ओमान
*   पहाबंगला
*   रशिया
*   थाईल्यान्ड

यो प्रमाणीकरणपछि विश्वको कति प्रतिशत जनसंख्या पोलियोमुक्त प्रमाणित क्षेत्रहरूमा बस्न पुग्यो?

उत्तर: यो प्रमाणीकरणपछि विश्वको लगभग 95% जनसंख्या पोलियोमुक्त प्रमाणित क्षेत्रहरूमा बस्न पुग्यो।","विश्व स्वास्थ्य संगठनको दक्षिण-पूर्व एसिया क्षेत्रलाई सन् २०१४ मार्च २७ मा पोलियोमुक्त प्रमाणित गरिएको थियो। यस क्षेत्रमा ११ देश (बंगलादेश, भुटान, उत्तर कोरिया, भारत, इन्डोनेसिया, माल्दिभ्स, म्यानमार, नेपाल, श्रीलंका, थाइल्यान्ड, र टिमोर-लेस्टे) समावेश छन्। यस प्रमाणीकरणसँगै विश्वको ८०% जनसंख्या पोलियोमुक्त प्रमाणित क्षेत्रहरूमा बस्न पुग्यो।",Correct,None,False,False
SCI-092,English,"Nepal released its first-ever consolidated national snow leopard population estimate in April 2025. What was the estimated population and density, and how does Nepal's snow leopard population rank among Asia's range countries compared to China, Mongolia, India, and Bhutan?","Okay, let’s break down this question about Nepal’s snow leopards based on the provided text.

**Here’s a summary of what we know:**

*   **Estimated Population & Density (April 2025):** The report states that Nepal's estimated population of snow leopards was **approximately 780 individuals** and a density of approximately **1 individual per square kilometer**.
*   **Ranking Among Asia’s Range Countries:** According to the text, Nepal’s snow leopard population ranks as the **third-highest in Asia**, behind China and Mongolia.

Let me know if you'd like me to elaborate on any specific aspect or provide further details!","Nepal's first national estimate placed its snow leopard population at 397 individuals, with a mean density of 1.56 individuals per 100 square kilometres. By country ranking, China has the largest population (about 2,000-2,500), followed by Mongolia (953), India (718), Nepal (397), and Bhutan (134) - making Nepal the fourth largest snow leopard population among these range countries despite holding only about 2% of the species' global habitat.",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
SCI-092,Nepali,"नेपालले सन् २०२५ अप्रिलमा हिउँचितुवाको पहिलो एकीकृत राष्ट्रिय जनसंख्या अनुमान सार्वजनिक गर्‍यो। अनुमानित जनसंख्या र घनत्व कति थियो, र चीन, मंगोलिया, भारत, र भुटानको तुलनामा एसियाका हिउँचितुवा बासस्थान भएका देशहरूमध्ये नेपालको स्थान कहाँ पर्छ?","नेपालले सन् २०२५ अप्रिल मा हिउँचितुवाको पहिलो एकीकृत राष्ट्रिय जनसंख्या अनुमान सार्वजनिक गर्‍यो। अनुमानित जनसंख्या र घनत्व कति थियो, र चीन, मंगोलिया, भारत, र भुटानको तुलनामा एसियाका हिउँचितुवा बासस्थान भएका देशहरूमध्ये नेपालको स्थान कहाँ पर्छ?

अनुमानित जनसंख्या लगभग 38 लाख 62 हजार भ थिए। उनका अनुमान अनुसार, नेपालले चीन, मंगोलिया, भारत, र भुटानको तुलनामा एसियाका हिउँचितुवा बासस्थानका लागि सबैभन्दा ठूलो स्थान थियो।","नेपालको पहिलो राष्ट्रिय अनुमानले हिउँचितुवाको जनसंख्या ३९७ रहेको देखाएको छ, जसको औसत घनत्व प्रति १०० वर्ग किलोमिटरमा १.५६ रहेको छ। देशगत क्रमअनुसार चीनमा सबैभन्दा बढी (लगभग २,०००-२,५००), त्यसपछि मंगोलिया (९५३), भारत (७१८), नेपाल (३९७), र भुटान (१३४) रहेका छन् - अर्थात् विश्वको जम्मा हिउँचितुवा बासस्थानको लगभग २% मात्र भएपनि नेपाल यी देशहरूमध्ये चौथो ठूलो जनसंख्या भएको देश हो।",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
ECO-008,English,"Per Nepal Rastra Bank's eleven-month 2082/83 report, what was Nepal's overall Balance of Payments (BoP) surplus in Rs. billion during the review period versus the same period a year earlier, and what was the current account surplus in Rs. billion for the same two periods?","According to the provided text, Nepal’s overall Balance of Payment (BoP) surplus in 2082/83 was ₹ 1,76,000 crore (approximately $245 million). The current account surplus for the same period a year earlier was ₹ 98,000 crore (approximately $120 million).","The Balance of Payments (BoP) remained at a surplus of Rs. 926.06 billion in the eleven months of 2082/83. The current account remained at a surplus of Rs. 802.06 billion in the same period, compared to a current account surplus of Rs. 321.74 billion in the same eleven months of the previous fiscal year (2081/82).",Correct,None,False,False
ECO-008,Nepali,"नेपाल राष्ट्र बैंकको आर्थिक वर्ष २०८२/८३ को एघार महिने प्रतिवेदन अनुसार, समीक्षा अवधि र एक वर्षअघिको सोही अवधिमा नेपालको समग्र भुक्तानी सन्तुलन (बीओपी) मुनाफा रु. अर्बमा कति-कति रह्यो, र सोही दुई अवधिको चालु खाता मुनाफा रु. अर्बमा कति-कति रह्यो?","According to the Nepal National Bank’s 2082/83 Economic Year Report, the total savings and insurance balance (BSB) surplus in Nepal during the review period and the preceding one year amounted to approximately Rubas crore (Rs. 100 Crore) each. The profit earned during the same two periods was also around Rs. 100 Crore.","भुक्तानी सन्तुलन (बीओपी) आर्थिक वर्ष २०८२/८३ को एघार महिनामा रु. ९२६.०६ अर्बको मुनाफामा रहेको छ। सोही अवधिमा चालु खाता रु. ८०२.०६ अर्बको मुनाफामा रहेको छ, जुन अघिल्लो आर्थिक वर्ष (२०८१/८२) को सोही एघार महिनामा रु. ३२१.७४ अर्ब थियो।",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
ECO-009,English,"In the eleven months of fiscal year 2082/83, how much foreign direct investment (equity only) did Nepal receive, and how much net capital transfer was recorded, compared to the same period of the previous fiscal year, per Nepal Rastra Bank?",Please provide me with the data from Nepal Rastra Bank. I need the figures for foreign direct investment and net capital transfers for the eleven months of fiscal year 2082/83 to answer your question accurately. 😊,"Rs. 22.82 billion in foreign direct investment (equity only) was received in the eleven months of 2082/83, up from Rs. 11.07 billion in the same period of the previous fiscal year. Net capital transfer amounted to Rs. 17.03 billion, up from Rs. 8.96 billion a year earlier.",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
ECO-009,Nepali,"आर्थिक वर्ष २०८२/८३ को एघार महिनामा नेपालले कति प्रत्यक्ष वैदेशिक लगानी (इक्विटी मात्र) प्राप्त गर्‍यो, र कति खुद पुँजीगत हस्तान्तरण दर्ता भयो, अघिल्लो आर्थिक वर्षको सोही अवधिको तुलनामा, नेपाल राष्ट्र बैंकका अनुसार?","नेपालले एघार महिना मा आर्थिक वर्ष २०८२/८३ को कति प्रत्यक्ष वैदेशिक लगानी (इक्विटी मात्र) प्राप्त गर्‍यो, र कति खुद पुँजीगत हस्तान्तरण दर्ता भयो, अघिल्लो आर्थिक वर्षको सोही अवधिको तुलनामा, नेपाल राष्ट्र बैंकका अनुसार?

नेपालले एघार महिना मा आर्थिक वर्ष २०८२/८३ को ५७६.९ मिलियन अमेरिकी डलर (USD) प्रत्यक्ष वैदेशिक लगानी प्राप्त गर्‍यो, र कति खुद पुँजीगत हस्तान्तरण दर्ता भयो, अघिल्लो आर्थिक वर्षको सोही अवधिको तुलनामा, नेपाल राष्ट्र बैंकका अनुसार?","आर्थिक वर्ष २०८२/८३ को एघार महिनामा रु. २२.८२ अर्ब प्रत्यक्ष वैदेशिक लगानी (इक्विटी मात्र) प्राप्त भएको छ, जुन अघिल्लो आर्थिक वर्षको सोही अवधिको रु. ११.०७ अर्बभन्दा बढी हो। खुद पुँजीगत हस्तान्तरण रु. १७.०३ अर्ब रहेको छ, जुन एक वर्षअघि रु. ८.९६ अर्ब थियो।",Correct,None,False,False
ECO-010,English,"According to Nepal Rastra Bank's eleven-month 2082/83 report, by what percentage did the international price of Brent crude oil increase in mid-June 2026 from a year earlier, and by what percentage did the international price of gold increase over the same period?","According to Nepal Rastra Bank’s eleven-month 2082/83 report, the international price of Brent crude oil increased by approximately **1.7%** in mid-June 2026 from a year earlier. The international price of gold also increased by approximately **4.5%** over the same period.","The price of Brent crude oil increased 16.63% to USD 88.64 per barrel in mid-June 2026 from USD 76.0 a year ago. The price of gold increased 21.85% to USD 4,185.95 per ounce in mid-June 2026 from USD 3,435.35 a year ago.",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
ECO-010,Nepali,"नेपाल राष्ट्र बैंकको आर्थिक वर्ष २०८२/८३ को एघार महिने प्रतिवेदन अनुसार, २०२६ जुन मध्यमा अन्तर्राष्ट्रिय बजारमा ब्रेन्ट कच्चा तेलको मूल्य एक वर्षअघिको तुलनामा कति प्रतिशतले बढ्यो, र सोही अवधिमा सुनको अन्तर्राष्ट्रिय मूल्य कति प्रतिशतले बढ्यो?","According to the Nepal Bank’s Quarterly Economic Report for August 2082, crude oil prices increased by one year compared to the previous month in June 2026. Similarly, gold international prices rose by two percent during that period.","ब्रेन्ट कच्चा तेलको मूल्य २०२६ जुन मध्यमा १६.६३% ले बढेर प्रति ब्यारेल अमेरिकी डलर ८८.६४ पुगेको छ, जुन एक वर्षअघि डलर ७६.० थियो। सुनको मूल्य १६.६३% होइन २१.८५% ले बढेर प्रति औंस अमेरिकी डलर ४,१८५.९५ पुगेको छ, जुन एक वर्षअघि डलर ३,४३५.३५ थियो।",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
ECO-011,English,"In the eleven months of fiscal year 2082/83, what was the Government of Nepal's total revenue mobilization in Rs. billion, and how much of that was tax revenue versus non-tax revenue, according to Nepal Rastra Bank?","According to Nepal Rastra Bank, the government’s total revenue mobilization in fiscal year 2082/83 was approximately Rs. 167 billion. Of this, tax revenue accounted for about Rs. 85 billion and non-tax revenue amounted to Rs. 82 billion.","Total revenue mobilization (including amounts to be transferred to provincial and local governments) stood at Rs. 1,081.31 billion, of which tax revenue amounted to Rs. 981.35 billion and non-tax revenue amounted to approximately Rs. 99.96 billion.",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
ECO-011,Nepali,"आर्थिक वर्ष २०८२/८३ को एघार महिनामा नेपाल सरकारको कुल राजस्व परिचालन रु. अर्बमा कति रह्यो, र त्यसमध्ये कर राजस्व र गैर-कर राजस्व कति-कति रह्यो, नेपाल राष्ट्र बैंकका अनुसार?","According to the National Bank of Nepal, in fiscal year 2082/83, the total revenue generated by the government was रु. 18 billion (approximately). Here’s a breakdown of the revenue composition:

**Total Revenue:** रु. 18 Billion

**Tax Revenue:**
*   **Corporate Income Tax:** रु. 6 Billion
*   **Value Added Tax (VAT):** रु. 6 Billion
*   **Other Taxes & Fees:** रु. 2 Billion

**Non-Revenue Revenue:**
*   **Interest Earned:** रु. 3 Billion
*   **Capital Gains:** रु. 1 Billion
*   **Other Non-Tax Revenue:** रु. 400 Million (This category includes various revenue streams like dividends, royalties, etc.)

Please note that these figures are estimates based on available data and may vary slightly depending on the specific accounting methods used by the National Bank of Nepal.","कुल राजस्व परिचालन (प्रदेश तथा स्थानीय सरकारलाई हस्तान्तरण गरिने रकमसहित) रु. १,०८१.३१ अर्ब रहेको छ, जसमध्ये कर राजस्व रु. ९८१.३५ अर्ब र गैर-कर राजस्व लगभग रु. ९९.९६ अर्ब रहेको छ।",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
HEA-093,English,"According to Nepal Demographic and Health Survey (NDHS) data analyzed in a peer-reviewed study, how did Nepal's full childhood vaccination coverage change across the 2001, 2011, and 2016 surveys — did it rise steadily, or did it rise and then fall?","The Nepal’s full childhood vaccination coverage rose from 65.6% in 2001 to a peak of 87.0% in 2011, but then declined to 77.8% in 2016. It did not rise steadily; it fluctuated between these levels.","Full vaccination coverage among infants rose from 65.6% in 2001 to a peak of 87.0% in 2011, but then declined to 77.8% in 2016 — a non-monotonic trend, not a steady increase.",Partially Correct,Omission,True,False
HEA-093,Nepali,"नेपाल जनसांख्यिक तथा स्वास्थ्य सर्वेक्षण (एनडीएचएस) को तथ्याङ्कमा आधारित एक समकक्ष-समीक्षित (पियर-रिभ्युड) अध्ययन अनुसार, सन् २००१, २०११, र २०१६ को सर्वेक्षणहरूमा नेपालको पूर्ण बाल खोप कभरेज कसरी परिवर्तन भयो — के यो निरन्तर बढ्यो, कि बढेर फेरि घट्यो?","According to the Nepal Demographic and Health Survey (NDHS) data analyzed in a peer-reviewed study, Nepal’s full childhood vaccination coverage rose from 65.6% in 2001 to a peak of 87.0% in 2011, but then declined to 77.8% in 2016 – a non-monotonic trend, not a steady increase.","शिशुहरूमा पूर्ण खोप कभरेज सन् २००१ को ६५.६%बाट बढेर सन् २०११ मा उच्चतम ८७.०% पुगेको थियो, तर त्यसपछि सन् २०१६ मा घटेर ७७.८% मा झरेको थियो — यो निरन्तर वृद्धि नभई बढेर फेरि घट्ने प्रवृत्ति हो।",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
EDU-094,English,"What was Nepal's Secondary Education Examination (SEE) overall pass percentage in 2080 BS, 2081 BS, and 2082 BS (published May 2026) respectively, according to the National Examinations Board?","The SEE pass percentage was 47.86% in 2080 BS, 61.81% in 2081 BS, and 65.98% in 2082 BS (published May 2026).","The SEE pass percentage was 47.86% in 2080 BS, 61.81% in 2081 BS, and 65.98% in 2082 BS (published 11 May 2026) - an improvement of 4.17 percentage points from 2081 to 2082.",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
EDU-094,Nepali,"राष्ट्रिय परीक्षा बोर्डका अनुसार, नेपालको माध्यमिक शिक्षा परीक्षा (एसईई) को समग्र उत्तीर्ण प्रतिशत सन् २०८० सालमा, २०८१ सालमा, र २०८२ सालमा (मे २०२६ मा प्रकाशित) क्रमशः कति-कति थियो?","The SEE pass percentage was 47.86% in 2080 BS, 61.81% in 2081 BS, and 65.98% in 2082 BS (published May 2026).","एसईईको उत्तीर्ण प्रतिशत सन् २०८० सालमा ४७.८६%, २०८१ सालमा ६१.८१%, र २०८२ सालमा (११ मे २०२६ मा प्रकाशित) ६५.९८% रहेको थियो - जुन २०८१ बाट २०८२ सम्म ४.१७ प्रतिशत विन्दुको सुधार हो।",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
EDU-095,English,"For SEE 2082 (results published May 2026), how many students registered for the exam, how many actually appeared/sat the exam, how many received a passing grade, and how many received a Non-Graded (NG) result?","512,421 students registered for SEE 2082, of whom 430,667 actually appeared/sat the exam. Of those who appeared, 284,160 received a passing grade and 1,46,507 received a Non-Graded (NG) result.","512,421 students registered for SEE 2082, of whom 430,667 actually appeared/sat the exam. Of those who appeared, 284,160 received a passing grade and 146,507 received a Non-Graded (NG) result.",Correct,None,False,False
EDU-095,Nepali,"एसईई २०८२ (मे २०२६ मा प्रकाशित नतिजा) का लागि कति विद्यार्थीले दर्ता गरे, कतिले वास्तवमा परीक्षा दिए, कतिले उत्तीर्ण ग्रेड पाए, र कतिले नन-ग्रेडेड (एनजी) नतिजा पाए?","512,421 students registered for SEE 2082, of whom 430,667 actually appeared/sat the exam. Of those who appeared, 284,160 received a passing grade and 1,46,507 received a Non-Graded (NG) result.","एसईई २०८२ का लागि ५,१२,४२१ विद्यार्थीले दर्ता गरेका थिए, जसमध्ये ४,३०,६६७ जनाले वास्तवमा परीक्षा दिए। परीक्षा दिनेमध्ये २,८४,१६० जनाले उत्तीर्ण ग्रेड पाए र १,४६,५०७ जनाले नन-ग्रेडेड (एनजी) नतिजा पाए।",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
SCI-093,English,"Per the 2019 National Geographic and Rolex Perpetual Planet Everest Expedition study (led by University of Maine researchers), how much thickness has Mount Everest's South Col Glacier lost in the last 25 years, and how many times faster is it thinning compared to the roughly 2,000 years it took to form?","The South Col Glacier on Mount Everest has lost up to 55 metres of thickness in the last 25 years, and is thinning more than 80 times faster than the roughly 2,000 years it took to form.","The South Col Glacier, near the summit of Mount Everest (around 7,906-8,020m elevation), has lost up to 55 metres of thickness in the last 25 years, and is thinning more than 80 times faster than the roughly 2,000 years it took to form - a rate that could see it disappear entirely by the middle of this century.",Correct,None,False,False
SCI-093,Nepali,"सन् २०१९ को राष्ट्रिय भौगोलिक (नेशनल जियोग्राफिक) र रोलेक्स पर्पेच्युअल प्लानेट सगरमाथा अभियानको अध्ययन (युनिभर्सिटी अफ मेन का अनुसन्धानकर्ताहरूको नेतृत्वमा) अनुसार, सगरमाथाको साउथ कोल हिमनदीले विगत २५ वर्षमा कति बाक्लोपन (मोटाइ) गुमाएको छ, र यो हिमनदी निर्माण हुन लागेको लगभग २,००० वर्षको तुलनामा कति गुणा छिटो पग्लिरहेको छ?","The South Col Glacier has lost up to 55 metres of thickness in the last 25 years, and is thinning more than 80 times faster than the roughly 2,000 years it took to form - a rate that could see it disappear entirely by the middle of this century.","सगरमाथाको शिखर नजिकैको साउथ कोल हिमनदी (लगभग ७,९०६-८,०२० मिटर उचाइमा) ले विगत २५ वर्षमा ५५ मिटरसम्म बाक्लोपन गुमाएको छ, र यो हिमनदी बन्न लागेको लगभग २,००० वर्षको तुलनामा ८० गुणाभन्दा बढी छिटो पग्लिरहेको छ - यही दरमा यो शताब्दीको मध्यसम्ममा पूर्णतया लोप हुनसक्छ।",Incorrect,Wrong Quantity/Number,True,True
